cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "ReSIDS: A Resilient, Adaptive, runtime-Switchable Federated–Gossip IDS for IEC 61850 Power Systems"
abstract: >-
  ReSIDS / ereno-Adaptativo is an intrusion-detection pipeline that unifies
  centralized, federated and gossip learning in a single run with round-by-round
  mode switching, built on Flower, scikit-learn and XGBoost. Version 2 adds a
  distributed, automatic FL<->GL switch driven by decentralized failure detection
  (fail-fast on local corroboration; careful, unanimity-based recovery), an
  outbound observability monitor (REST + CoAP), and a control plane (mode votes +
  peer suspicions) piggybacked on the GLow gossip substrate.
type: software
version: 2.0.0
